                    briefing_en: '<b>Year 2.5 — The Global Competitive Game</b><br><br>Rio Pacific Ltd. has announced a strategic review of LATAM mining services opportunities. Your Australia entry directly affects the competitive dynamics of your home market. Remember: in mining services, where major projects are global tenders, entering Australia creates direct competitive exposure with Rio Pacific in future LATAM tenders.<br><br>An Australian mining-services firm in Perth has offered a joint venture: 51-49 with MSP as majority if the Canadian technology comes into the venture, otherwise 50-50. Choose your Australia entry mode, timing strategy, and competitive response to Rio Pacific. This is not just a market access decision — it is a global competitive strategy decision.',
                    briefing_es: '<b>Año 2.5 — El Juego Competitivo Global</b><br><br>Rio Pacific Ltd. ha anunciado una revisión estratégica de oportunidades de servicios mineros en LATAM. Su entrada a Australia afecta directamente la dinámica competitiva de su mercado local. Recuerden: en servicios mineros, donde los grandes proyectos son licitaciones globales, entrar a Australia crea exposición competitiva directa con Rio Pacific en futuras licitaciones LATAM.<br><br>Una firma australiana de servicios mineros de Perth ofrece un joint venture: 51-49 con MSP como mayoritario si la tecnología canadiense entra al negocio, si no 50-50. Elijan su modo de entrada a Australia, el momento de entrar y la respuesta competitiva a Rio Pacific.'
                },
                {
                    title_en: 'Round 4: Portfolio Optimization and Strategic Architecture',
                    title_es: 'Ronda 4: Optimización del Portafolio y Arquitectura Estratégica',
                    briefing_en: '<b>Year 3 — Strategic Architecture Review</b><br><br>MSP now operates in 2-4 international markets with varying degrees of success. Review each market against the original OLI assessment: should you deepen commitment, maintain current operations, restructure the entry mode, or exit?<br><br>As MSP has evolved from a domestic company to a multilatina with advanced market presence, choose the organizational structure that best supports your international portfolio. Apply the logic of structural fit: does your mix of WOS, JV, and licensing arrangements require a Global Product Division, Geographic Area Structure, International Division, or Matrix organization?',
                    briefing_es: '<b>Año 3 — Revisión de Arquitectura Estratégica</b><br><br>MSP ahora opera en 2-4 mercados internacionales con diferentes grados de éxito. Revisen cada mercado contra la evaluación OLI original: ¿deben profundizar, mantener, reestructurar el modo de entrada, o salir?<br><br>A medida que MSP ha evolucionado de empresa doméstica a multilatina con presencia en mercados avanzados, elijan la estructura organizacional que mejor soporte su portafolio internacional.'
                }
            ];

            this.RANDOM_EVENTS = [
                [
                    { prob: 0.25, text_en: 'Peru introduces new Ley General de Minería restricting foreign service contractors. WOS compliance cost increases; JV becomes more attractive.', text_es: 'Perú introduce nueva Ley General de Minería restringiendo contratistas extranjeros. El costo de cumplimiento de filial propia aumenta; JV se vuelve más atractivo.', effect: 'peru_regulation' }
                ],
                [
                    { prob: 0.40, text_en: 'Brazilian JV partner files competing patent on OrePlan Pro interface adaptation. IP dispute forces course correction.', text_es: 'El socio de JV brasileño presenta patente competitiva sobre la adaptación de la interfaz de OrePlan Pro. La disputa de PI fuerza corrección.', effect: 'brazil_ip_dispute', condition: 'brazil_jv' },
                    { prob: 0.30, text_en: 'Copper price drops 22% due to China demand shock. Chilean mining capex deferred 18 months. International diversification urgency increases.', text_es: 'El precio del cobre cae 22% por shock de demanda china. Capex minero chileno diferido 18 meses. Aumenta urgencia de diversificación internacional.', effect: 'copper_crash' },
                    { prob: 0.25, text_en: 'Canadian government mineral technology tax credit covers 35% of WOS establishment cost. Greenfield becomes significantly more attractive.', text_es: 'Crédito fiscal del gobierno canadiense para tecnología mineral cubre 35% del costo de establecimiento de filial propia. Greenfield se vuelve significativamente más atractivo.', effect: 'canada_tax_credit' }
                ],
                [
                    { prob: 0.35, text_en: 'Rio Pacific Ltd. acquires a Peruvian mining services company, entering LATAM directly. Competitive threat is now concrete.', text_es: 'Rio Pacific Ltd. adquiere una empresa peruana de servicios mineros, entrando directamente a LATAM. La amenaza competitiva es ahora concreta.', effect: 'rio_latam_entry' },
                    { prob: 0.20, text_en: 'Australian regulator AMMA requires foreign mining equipment operators to meet AS 4600 standards. WOS greenfield entry becomes harder; alliance or acquisition preferred.', text_es: 'El regulador australiano AMMA exige que operadores extranjeros de equipos mineros cumplan con estándares AS 4600. La entrada greenfield se dificulta; se prefiere alianza o adquisición.', effect: 'australia_regulation' }
                ],
                [
                    { prob: 0.30, text_en: 'The largest Chilean state-owned miner announces an evaluation of OrePlan Pro as its planning standard. IP value amplified; licensing negotiation leverage increases globally.', text_es: 'La mayor minera estatal chilena anuncia la evaluación de OrePlan Pro como su estándar de planificación. El valor de PI se amplifica; aumenta el apalancamiento de negociación de licencias globalmente.', effect: 'codelco_standard' }
                ]
            ];
        }

        initialize(state) {
            if (!state.domainState || Object.keys(state.domainState).length === 0) {
                state.domainState = {
                    budget: 18.5,
                    budgetSpent: 0,
                    portfolioIRR: 0,
                    totalLicenses: 67,
                    ipScore: 100,
                    gcpi: 50,
                    marketPenetration: 0,
                    peruMode: '',
                    brazilMode: '',
                    canadaMode: '',
                    australiaMode: '',
                    peruBudget: 0,
                    brazilBudget: 0,
                    peruPenetration: 0,
                    brazilPenetration: 0,
                    canadaPenetration: 0,
                    australiaPenetration: 0,
                    brazilCorrection: '',
                    canadaGovernance: '',
                    competIntel: false,
                    australiaTiming: '',
                    rioResponse: '',
                    portfolioReview: {},
                    orgArchitecture: '',
                    irrHistory: [],
                    licensesHistory: [],
                    gcpiHistory: [],
                    activeEvents: [],
                    capabilityScore: 0,
                    rioLatamShare: 5,
                    copperCrash: false,
                    canadaTaxCredit: false,
                    codelcoStandard: false
                };
            }
            if (!state.decisions || Object.keys(state.decisions).length === 0) {
                state.decisions = {
                    primary: '',
                    secondary: '',
                    tertiary: '',
                    quaternary: '',
                    budgetAlloc: 1.9
                };
            }
            this._ensureModelState(state.domainState);
            this._bindLangRepaint();
            this._updateBriefing(state);
        }

        _lang() {
            var l = (window.vcI18n && window.vcI18n._lang) || (document.documentElement && document.documentElement.lang) || 'en';
            l = String(l).split('-')[0].toLowerCase();
            return l === 'es' ? 'es' : 'en';
        }

        _bindLangRepaint() {
            if (this._langBound) return;
            this._langBound = true;
            var self = this;
            var repaint = function() {
                try {
                    var st = window.mySimulation && window.mySimulation.state;
                    if (!st) return;
                    var keep = {};
                    var box = document.getElementById('dynamicDecisions');
                    if (box) {
                        var els = box.querySelectorAll('select, input');
                        for (var i = 0; i < els.length; i++) if (els[i].id) keep[els[i].id] = els[i].value;
                    }
                    self._updateBriefing(st);
                    for (var id in keep) {
                        var el = document.getElementById(id);
                        if (el && keep[id] !== '') {
                            el.value = keep[id];
                            try { el.dispatchEvent(new Event('change', { bubbles: true })); } catch (e) {}
                        }
                    }
                } catch (e) {}
            };
            document.addEventListener('express:langchanged', repaint);
            try {
                if (window.mySimulation && window.mySimulation.eventBus) window.mySimulation.eventBus.on('language:changed', repaint);
            } catch (e) {}
        }

        _opt(value, en, es, lang) {
            return '<option value="' + value + '">' + (lang === 'es' ? es : en) + '</option>';
        }

        _group(id, labelEn, labelEs, lang, inner) {
            return '<div class="msp-entry-sim-decision-group"><label for="' + id + '">' + (lang === 'es' ? labelEs : labelEn) + '</label>' +
                '<select id="' + id + '">' + inner + '</select></div>';
        }

        _statusLine(ds, lang) {
            var es = lang === 'es';
            var mk = [['peru', 'Peru', 'Perú'], ['brazil', 'Brazil', 'Brasil'], ['canada', 'Canada', 'Canadá'], ['australia', 'Australia', 'Australia']];
            var parts = [];
            for (var i = 0; i < mk.length; i++) {
                if (ds[mk[i][0] + 'Mode'] && (ds[mk[i][0] + 'Penetration'] || 0) > 0) parts.push((es ? mk[i][2] : mk[i][1]) + ' ' + this._num(ds[mk[i][0] + 'Penetration'], 1, lang) + '%');
            }
            if (!parts.length) return '';
            var prof = (ds.profitHistory && ds.profitHistory.length) ? ds.profitHistory[ds.profitHistory.length - 1] : 0;
            return '<p class="msp-entry-sim-status-line"><b>' + (es ? 'Dónde están: ' : 'Where you stand: ') + '</b>' +
                (es ? 'penetración ' : 'penetration ') + parts.join(' · ') + '. ' +
                (es ? 'Utilidad internacional del último año: CLP ' : 'International profit last year: CLP ') + this._num(prof, 1, lang) + 'B. ' +
                (es ? 'Capital comprometido: CLP ' : 'Capital committed: CLP ') + this._num(ds.budgetSpent || 0, 1, lang) + 'B ' + (es ? 'de 18,5B.' : 'of 18.5B.') + '</p>';
        }

        /* the entered market with the lowest penetration, read from this run's state */
        _weakestMarket(ds) {
            var lang = this._lang(), es = lang === 'es';
            var mk = [['peru', 'Peru', 'Perú'], ['brazil', 'Brazil', 'Brasil'], ['canada', 'Canada', 'Canadá'], ['australia', 'Australia', 'Australia']];
            var best = null;
            for (var i = 0; i < mk.length; i++) {
                var mode = ds[mk[i][0] + 'Mode'];
                if (!mode || (ds[mk[i][0] + 'Ceil'] || 0) <= 0) continue;
                var pen = ds[mk[i][0] + 'Penetration'] || 0;
                if (!best || pen < best.pen) best = { m: mk[i], mode: mode, pen: pen };
            }
            if (!best) return '';
            var em = this.ENTRY_MODES[best.mode];
            var modeName = em ? (es ? em.label_es : em.label_en) : best.mode;
            return es ? ('La posición más débil quedó en ' + best.m[2] + ': ' + this._num(best.pen, 1, lang) + '% de penetración con ' + modeName + '. Comparen ese modo con la distancia institucional de ' + best.m[2] + '.')
                      : ('The weakest position ended in ' + best.m[1] + ': ' + this._num(best.pen, 1, lang) + '% penetration with ' + modeName + '. Compare that mode with ' + best.m[1] + '’s institutional distance.');
        }

        _kpiLine(ds) {
            var lang = this._lang(), es = lang === 'es';
            return (es ? 'Al cierre: protección de PI ' : 'At the close: IP protection ') + Math.round(ds.ipScore || 0) + '/100, ' +
                (es ? 'IGPC ' : 'GCPI ') + Math.round(ds.gcpi || 0) + ', ' +
                (es ? 'capacidad internacional acumulada ' : 'international capability built ') + Math.round(ds.capabilityScore || 0) + '/100.';
        }

        _valueLine(ds) {
            var lang = this._lang(), es = lang === 'es';
            return (es ? 'Valor creado: CLP ' : 'Value created: CLP ') + this._num(ds.portfolioValue || 0, 1, lang) + 'B; ' +
                (es ? 'capital comprometido: CLP ' : 'capital committed: CLP ') + this._num(ds.capexTotal || ds.budgetSpent || 0, 1, lang) + 'B.';
        }

        _num(v, dec, lang) {
            var s = (Number(v) || 0).toFixed(dec);
            return lang === 'es' ? s.replace('.', ',') : s;
        }

        _updateBriefing(state) {
            var idx = Math.min((state.currentPeriod || 1) - 1, this.ROUNDS.length - 1);
            var round = this.ROUNDS[idx];
            var lang = this._lang();
            var es = lang === 'es';
            var ds = state.domainState || {};

            /* v2.0.1: chart and table text alternatives follow the session language (F21, F24) */
            var _alt = [['portfolioChart', 'Return on capital and GCPI by round; the history table below lists the same figures', 'Retorno del capital e IGPC por ronda; la tabla de historial de abajo muestra las mismas cifras'],
                ['licensesChart', 'OrePlan Pro licenses by round; the history table below lists the same figures', 'Licencias de OrePlan Pro por ronda; la tabla de historial de abajo muestra las mismas cifras'],
                ['usfHistoryTable', 'Round history', 'Historial de rondas']];
            for (var _ai = 0; _ai < _alt.length; _ai++) { var _ae = document.getElementById(_alt[_ai][0]); if (_ae) _ae.setAttribute('aria-label', es ? _alt[_ai][2] : _alt[_ai][1]); }
            var briefEl = document.getElementById('briefingText');
            if (briefEl) {
                briefEl.innerHTML = (es ? round.briefing_es : round.briefing_en) + this._statusLine(ds, lang);
            }

            var eventPanel = document.getElementById('eventPanel');
            var eventText = document.getElementById('eventText');
            if (eventPanel && eventText) {
                var roundEvents = (ds.activeEvents || []).filter(function(e) { return e.round === idx - 1 || e.round === idx; });
                if (roundEvents.length > 0) {
                    eventPanel.style.display = 'block';
                    eventText.innerHTML = roundEvents.map(function(e) { return es ? e.text_es : e.text_en; }).join('<br><br>');
                } else {
                    eventPanel.style.display = 'none';
                }
            }

            var dynPanel = document.getElementById('dynamicDecisions');
            if (!dynPanel) return;
            var period = state.currentPeriod || 1;
            var _maxP = (window.mySimulation && window.mySimulation.state && window.mySimulation.state.maxPeriods) || this.ROUNDS.length;
            if (period > _maxP) {
                dynPanel.innerHTML = '';
                var _decPanel = document.getElementById('decisionsPanel');
                if (_decPanel) _decPanel.style.display = 'none';
                this._updateMarketGrid(ds, lang);
                return;
            }

            var o = this._opt.bind(this);
            var html = '';
            if (period === 1) {
                html += this._group('primaryInput', 'Peru entry mode', 'Modo de entrada a Perú', lang,
                    o('branch', 'Upgrade the Lima office to a full branch', 'Convertir la oficina de Lima en sucursal', lang) +
                    o('wos_greenfield', 'Wholly owned greenfield subsidiary in Lima', 'Filial propia greenfield en Lima', lang) +
                    o('jv', 'Joint venture with a Peruvian equipment dealer', 'Joint venture con un distribuidor peruano', lang) +
                    o('licensing', 'License OrePlan Pro to Peruvian contractors', 'Licenciar OrePlan Pro a contratistas peruanos', lang));
                html += this._group('secondaryInput', 'Brazil entry mode', 'Modo de entrada a Brasil', lang,
                    o('export', 'Export from Chile, no local presence', 'Exportar desde Chile, sin presencia local', lang) +
                    o('licensing', 'Agent and distributor agreement in Brazil', 'Contrato con agente y distribuidor en Brasil', lang) +
                    o('jv', 'Minority JV with Serviços Minerais do Brasil', 'JV minoritario con Serviços Minerais do Brasil', lang) +
                    o('wos_greenfield', 'Wholly owned greenfield subsidiary in Pará', 'Filial propia greenfield en Pará', lang));
                html += '<div class="msp-entry-sim-decision-group"><label for="budgetInput">' +
                    (es ? 'Presupuesto del año 1 para Perú (CLP B, de 0,5 a 3,3). El resto de los 3,8B va a Brasil.' : 'Year-1 budget for Peru (CLP B, 0.5 to 3.3). The rest of the 3.8B goes to Brazil.') +
                    '</label><input type="number" id="budgetInput" min="0.5" max="3.3" step="0.1" value="1.9"></div>';
            }
            if (period === 2) {
                var inner = '';
                if (ds.brazilMode === 'licensing' || ds.brazilMode === 'export') {
                    inner = o('upgrade_jv', 'Upgrade to a JV (CLP 1.5B)', 'Pasar a un JV (CLP 1,5B)', lang) +
                        o('upgrade_wos', 'Upgrade to a subsidiary (CLP 1.5B)', 'Pasar a filial propia (CLP 1,5B)', lang) +
                        o('maintain', 'Keep the current mode (no cost)', 'Mantener el modo actual (sin costo)', lang);
                } else if (ds.brazilMode === 'jv') {
                    inner = o('escalate_legal', 'Take the IP dispute to court (CLP 0.8B)', 'Llevar la disputa de PI a juicio (CLP 0,8B)', lang) +
                        o('renegotiate', 'Renegotiate the JV terms (CLP 0.3B)', 'Renegociar los términos del JV (CLP 0,3B)', lang) +
                        o('convert_wos', 'Buy out the partner (CLP 2.5B)', 'Comprar la parte del socio (CLP 2,5B)', lang);
                } else {
                    inner = o('accelerate', 'Accelerate the build-out (CLP 1.5B)', 'Acelerar el despliegue (CLP 1,5B)', lang) +
                        o('maintain', 'Hold the current pace (no cost)', 'Mantener el ritmo actual (sin costo)', lang);
                }
                html += this._group('primaryInput', 'Brazil course correction', 'Corrección de curso en Brasil', lang, inner);
                html += this._group('secondaryInput', 'Canada entry mode', 'Modo de entrada a Canadá', lang,
                    o('licensing', 'License OrePlan Pro to a Canadian distributor (CLP 0.8B)', 'Licenciar OrePlan Pro a un distribuidor canadiense (CLP 0,8B)', lang) +
                    o('wos_greenfield', 'Greenfield subsidiary in Vancouver (CLP 4.5B)', 'Filial greenfield en Vancouver (CLP 4,5B)', lang) +
                    o('wos_acquisition', 'Acquire TerraMap Systems, BC specialist (CLP 8.0B)', 'Adquirir TerraMap Systems, especialista de BC (CLP 8,0B)', lang) +
                    o('alliance_rd', 'R&D alliance with a Vancouver mining institute (CLP 1.5B)', 'Alianza de I+D con un instituto minero de Vancouver (CLP 1,5B)', lang));
                html += this._group('tertiaryInput', 'Competitive intelligence on Rio Pacific (CLP 0.4B)', 'Inteligencia competitiva sobre Rio Pacific (CLP 0,4B)', lang,
                    o('yes', 'Yes, fund the intelligence work', 'Sí, financiar la inteligencia', lang) +
                    o('no', 'No, keep the money for entries', 'No, guardar el dinero para entradas', lang));
            }
            if (period === 3) {
                html += this._group('primaryInput', 'Australia entry mode', 'Modo de entrada a Australia', lang,
                    o('licensing', 'License OrePlan Pro to an Australian firm (CLP 0.6B)', 'Licenciar OrePlan Pro a una firma australiana (CLP 0,6B)', lang) +
                    o('wos_greenfield', 'Wholly owned greenfield subsidiary in Perth (CLP 5.5B)', 'Filial propia greenfield en Perth (CLP 5,5B)', lang) +
                    o('wos_acquisition', 'Acquire Southern Cross Mining outright (CLP 10.0B)', 'Adquirir Southern Cross Mining completa (CLP 10,0B)', lang) +
                    o('jv', 'JV with the Perth partner, 51-49 if Canada tech comes (CLP 2.5B)', 'JV con el socio de Perth, 51-49 si llega la tecnología de Canadá (CLP 2,5B)', lang));
                html += this._group('secondaryInput', 'Australia entry timing', 'Momento de entrada a Australia', lang,
                    o('now', 'Enter now, ahead of Rio Pacific', 'Entrar ahora, antes que Rio Pacific', lang) +
                    o('delay', 'Enter in 18 months, after Canada', 'Entrar en 18 meses, después de Canadá', lang) +
                    o('conditional', 'Announce now, enter in 18 months', 'Anunciar ahora, entrar en 18 meses', lang));
                html += this._group('tertiaryInput', 'Response to Rio Pacific in Peru and Chile', 'Respuesta a Rio Pacific en Perú y Chile', lang,
                    o('price_deterrence', 'Cut prices in Chile and Peru (CLP 1.0B)', 'Bajar precios en Chile y Perú (CLP 1,0B)', lang) +
                    o('deepen_chile', 'Close local contracts, raise switching costs (CLP 1.5B)', 'Cerrar contratos locales, subir costos de cambio (CLP 1,5B)', lang) +
                    o('licensing_deal', 'Offer Rio Pacific a territorial license (royalties)', 'Ofrecer a Rio Pacific una licencia territorial (regalías)', lang) +
                    o('compete', 'No special response, compete on tenders', 'Sin respuesta especial, competir en licitaciones', lang));
            }
            if (period === 4) {
                var markets = [['peru', 'Peru', 'Perú'], ['brazil', 'Brazil', 'Brasil'], ['canada', 'Canada', 'Canadá'], ['australia', 'Australia', 'Australia']];
                for (var mi = 0; mi < markets.length; mi++) {
                    var mk = markets[mi][0];
                    if (ds[mk + 'Mode'] && !(mk === 'australia' && ds.ausPending)) {
                        html += this._group('review_' + mk, 'Portfolio review: ' + markets[mi][1], 'Revisión de portafolio: ' + markets[mi][2], lang,
                            o('deepen', 'Deepen the investment (CLP 1.5B)', 'Profundizar la inversión (CLP 1,5B)', lang) +
                            o('maintain', 'Maintain operations (no cost)', 'Mantener las operaciones (sin costo)', lang) +
                            o('restructure', 'Buy control back (CLP ' + this._num(this.RESTRUCTURE_COST[mk], 1, 'en') + 'B)', 'Recomprar el control (CLP ' + this._num(this.RESTRUCTURE_COST[mk], 1, 'es') + 'B)', lang) +
                            o('exit', 'Exit the market (recover CLP 0.5B)', 'Salir del mercado (recupera CLP 0,5B)', lang));
                    }
                }
                html += this._group('primaryInput', 'Organizational architecture', 'Arquitectura organizacional', lang,
                    o('international_div', 'International division beside the Chile business', 'División internacional junto al negocio de Chile', lang) +
                    o('global_product', 'Global divisions by product and service line', 'Divisiones globales por producto y servicio', lang) +
                    o('geographic', 'Geographic areas, each with its own head', 'Áreas geográficas, cada una con su gerente', lang) +
                    o('matrix', 'Matrix of service lines and geographies', 'Matriz de líneas de servicio y geografías', lang));
            }
            dynPanel.innerHTML = html;
            this._updateMarketGrid(ds, lang);
        }

        _updateMarketGrid(ds, lang) {
            var gridEl = document.getElementById('marketGrid');
            if (!gridEl) return;
            var es = lang === 'es';
            var markets = [
                { key: 'peru', name: 'Peru', nameEs: 'Perú', flag: '🇵🇪' },
                { key: 'brazil', name: 'Brazil', nameEs: 'Brasil', flag: '🇧🇷' },
                { key: 'canada', name: 'Canada', nameEs: 'Canadá', flag: '🇨🇦' },
                { key: 'australia', name: 'Australia', nameEs: 'Australia', flag: '🇦🇺' }
            ];
            var html = '';
            for (var i = 0; i < markets.length; i++) {
                var m = markets[i];
                var mode = ds[m.key + 'Mode'] || '';
                var pen = ds[m.key + 'Penetration'] || 0;
                var pending = (m.key === 'australia' && ds.ausPending);
                var isActive = mode !== '' && !pending;
                var modeName = (mode && this.ENTRY_MODES[mode]) ? (es ? this.ENTRY_MODES[mode].label_es : this.ENTRY_MODES[mode].label_en) : '';
                html += '<div class="msp-entry-sim-market-card ' + (isActive ? 'active' : 'pending') + '">';
                html += '<h5>' + m.flag + ' ' + (es ? m.nameEs : m.name) + '</h5>';
                if (isActive) {
                    html += '<div class="msp-entry-sim-market-mode">' + modeName + '</div>';
                    html += '<div class="msp-entry-sim-market-status">' + (es ? 'Penetración: ' : 'Penetration: ') + this._num(pen, 1, lang) + '%</div>';
                } else if (pending) {
                    html += '<div class="msp-entry-sim-market-mode">' + modeName + '</div>';
                    html += '<div class="msp-entry-sim-market-status">' + (es ? 'Entrada programada' : 'Entry scheduled') + '</div>';
                } else {
                    html += '<div class="msp-entry-sim-market-mode">' + (es ? 'Pendiente' : 'Pending') + '</div>';
                }
                html += '</div>';
            }
            gridEl.innerHTML = html;
        }

        validateDecisions(decisions) {
            var period = window.mySimulation.state.currentPeriod || 1;

            var primary = document.getElementById('primaryInput');
            if (primary) decisions.primary = primary.value;

            var secondary = document.getElementById('secondaryInput');
            if (secondary) decisions.secondary = secondary.value;

            var tertiary = document.getElementById('tertiaryInput');
            if (tertiary) decisions.tertiary = tertiary.value;

            var budgetEl = document.getElementById('budgetInput');
            if (budgetEl) decisions.budgetAlloc = parseFloat(budgetEl.value);

            if (period === 1) {
                if (!decisions.budgetAlloc || decisions.budgetAlloc < 0.5 - 1e-9 || decisions.budgetAlloc > 3.3 + 1e-9) {
                    window.mySimulation.uiManager.showNotification(
                        window.mySimulation.t('budget_warning'), 'warning'
                    );
                    return false;
                }
            }

            if (period === 4) {
                var markets = ['peru', 'brazil', 'canada', 'australia'];
                decisions.portfolioReview = {};
                for (var i = 0; i < markets.length; i++) {
                    var revEl = document.getElementById('review_' + markets[i]);
                    if (revEl) decisions.portfolioReview[markets[i]] = revEl.value;
                }
            }

            /* v2.0.1: no re-render here; validation reads the controls and never rebuilds them (EQIL defect 11) */
            return true;
        }

        calculateResults(state) {
            return this._computeRound(state);
        }

        /* v2.0.0 round model. Each market earns a share of its profit pool; the share
           depends on the entry mode's fit with institutional distance (Kostova), the
           capability MSP has built in earlier markets (sequence), and how much the mode
           lets MSP keep (internalization, Dunning / Anderson-Gatignon). Costs: capital,
           facility draw beyond the CLP 18.5B programme, IP leakage, integration strain
           and Rio Pacific home-market erosion. The score is the value created. */
        _computeRound(state) {
            var d = state.decisions || {};
            var ds = state.domainState;
            var period = state.currentPeriod;
            var roundIdx = period - 1;
            var self = this;
            this._ensureModelState(ds);

            var events = this.RANDOM_EVENTS[roundIdx] || [];
            var triggered = [];
            for (var ei = 0; ei < events.length; ei++) {
                var ev = events[ei];
                if (ev.condition === 'brazil_jv' && ds.brazilMode !== 'jv') continue;
                if (Math.random() < ev.prob) {
                    triggered.push({ round: roundIdx, text_en: ev.text_en, text_es: ev.text_es, effect: ev.effect });
                    if (ev.effect === 'copper_crash') ds.copperCrash = true;
                    if (ev.effect === 'canada_tax_credit') ds.canadaTaxCredit = true;
                    if (ev.effect === 'codelco_standard') ds.codelcoStandard = true;
                }
            }
            ds.activeEvents = (ds.activeEvents || []).concat(triggered);
            var has = function(fx) { return triggered.some(function(e) { return e.effect === fx; }); };

            var capex = 0, load = 0, newLicenses = 0, ipDelta = 0, gcpiDelta = 0, capGain = 0;
            var M = this.MODE_ECON;

            if (period === 1) {
                ds.peruMode = d.primary;
                ds.brazilMode = d.secondary;
                var b = parseFloat(d.budgetAlloc);
                if (!(b >= 0.5 && b <= 3.3)) b = 1.9;
                ds.peruBudget = b;
                ds.brazilBudget = Math.round((3.8 - b) * 10) / 10;
                capex = 3.8;
                this._enter(ds, 'peru', ds.peruMode, this._funding('peru', ds.peruMode, ds.peruBudget), 1);
                this._enter(ds, 'brazil', ds.brazilMode, this._funding('brazil', ds.brazilMode, ds.brazilBudget), 1);
                if (has('peru_regulation')) {
                    if (ds.peruMode === 'wos_greenfield') { ds.peruPenetration *= 0.8; capex += 0.3; }
                    if (ds.peruMode === 'jv') ds.peruPenetration *= 1.1;
                }
                capGain = M[ds.peruMode].capGain + 0.8 * M[ds.brazilMode].capGain;
                ipDelta -= M[ds.peruMode].leak + (ds.brazilMode === 'jv' ? 12 : M[ds.brazilMode].leak);
                load = M[ds.peruMode].load + M[ds.brazilMode].load;
                newLicenses = M[ds.peruMode].lic + M[ds.brazilMode].lic + Math.round(1 + Math.random() * 3);
                gcpiDelta = 1;
            }

            if (period === 2) {
                ds.brazilCorrection = d.primary;
                ds.canadaMode = d.secondary;
                ds.competIntel = (d.tertiary === 'yes');
                var bc = ds.brazilCorrection;
                if (bc === 'upgrade_jv') { ds.brazilMode = 'jv'; ds.brazilCeil *= 1.15; capex += 1.5; load += 0.5; ipDelta -= 8; }
                else if (bc === 'upgrade_wos') { ds.brazilMode = 'wos_greenfield'; ds.brazilCeil *= 1.2; capex += 1.5; load += 0.8; capGain += 10; }
                else if (bc === 'convert_wos') { ds.brazilMode = 'wos_greenfield'; capex += 2.5; load += 0.8; capGain += 8; ds.ipLeakStopped = true; }
                else if (bc === 'escalate_legal') { capex += 0.8; ds.brazilPenetration *= 0.85; }
                else if (bc === 'renegotiate') { capex += 0.3; ipDelta -= 4; }
                else if (bc === 'accelerate') { ds.brazilCeil *= 1.12; capex += 1.5; load += 0.7; }
                if (has('brazil_ip_dispute')) {
                    if (bc === 'escalate_legal') ipDelta -= 4;
                    else if (bc === 'renegotiate') { ipDelta -= 10; ds.brazilPenetration *= 0.9; }
                    else if (bc === 'convert_wos') ipDelta -= 2;
                    else ipDelta -= 8;
                }
                var cm = ds.canadaMode;
                var cCost = { licensing: 0.8, wos_greenfield: 4.5, wos_acquisition: 8.0, alliance_rd: 1.5 }[cm];
                if (cCost === undefined) cCost = 0.8;
                if (ds.canadaTaxCredit && cm === 'wos_greenfield') cCost *= 0.65;
                capex += cCost;
                if (ds.competIntel) capex += 0.4;
                load += (M[cm] || M.licensing).load;
                var strainNow = this._strain(ds, load);
                this._grow(ds, strainNow);
                this._enter(ds, 'canada', cm, 1, 1 - 0.5 * strainNow);
                if (ds.canadaTaxCredit && cm === 'wos_greenfield') ds.canadaPenetration *= 1.15;
                if (cm === 'wos_acquisition') ds.techCap = true;
                capGain += (M[cm] || M.licensing).capGain;
                ipDelta -= (M[cm] || M.licensing).leak;
                newLicenses = Math.round(4 + Math.random() * 4) + (M[cm] || M.licensing).lic * 2;
                gcpiDelta = ds.competIntel ? 4 : 0;
            }

            if (period === 3) {
                ds.australiaMode = d.primary;
                ds.australiaTiming = d.secondary;
                ds.rioResponse = d.tertiary;
                var am = ds.australiaMode;
                var aCost = { licensing: 0.6, wos_greenfield: 5.5, wos_acquisition: 10.0, jv: 2.5 }[am];
                if (aCost === undefined) aCost = 0.6;
                if (has('australia_regulation') && am === 'wos_greenfield') aCost += 2.0;
                capex += aCost;
                var rr = ds.rioResponse;
                if (rr === 'price_deterrence') { capex += 1.0; ds.priceWar = true; ds.rioLatamShare -= 3; gcpiDelta += 2; }
                else if (rr === 'deepen_chile') { capex += 1.5; ds.switchingCosts = true; ds.rioLatamShare -= 2; gcpiDelta += 6; }
                else if (rr === 'licensing_deal') { ds.rivalArmed = true; ds.royalty = 0.6; ipDelta -= 18; newLicenses += 12; gcpiDelta += 3; }
                else { gcpiDelta -= 2; }
                if (has('rio_latam_entry')) {
                    var hit = 6 * (ds.switchingCosts ? 0.5 : 1) * (ds.competIntel ? 0.75 : 1);
                    ds.rioLatamShare += hit;
                    gcpiDelta -= Math.round(hit / 2);
                }
                if (ds.competIntel) gcpiDelta += 2;
                if (ds.australiaTiming === 'now') {
                    load += (M[am] || M.licensing).load;
                    ds.rioLatamShare += 4;
                } else if (ds.australiaTiming === 'conditional') {
                    ds.rioLatamShare += 2;
                }
                var st3 = this._strain(ds, load);
                this._grow(ds, st3);
                if (ds.australiaTiming === 'now') {
                    this._enter(ds, 'australia', am, 1, 1.1 * (1 - 0.5 * st3));
                    if (has('australia_regulation') && am === 'wos_greenfield') { ds.australiaCeil *= 0.8; ds.australiaPenetration *= 0.8; }
                    capGain += (M[am] || M.licensing).capGain * 0.5;
                    ipDelta -= this._ausLeak(am);
                    newLicenses += (M[am] || M.licensing).lic;
                } else {
                    ds.ausPending = true;
                    if (has('australia_regulation') && am === 'wos_greenfield') ds.ausRegHit = true;
                }
                newLicenses += Math.round(3 + Math.random() * 4);
            }

            if (period === 4) {
                ds.orgArchitecture = d.primary;
                ds.portfolioReview = d.portfolioReview || {};
                var orgCost = { matrix: 0.8, global_product: 0.5, geographic: 0.5, international_div: 0.2 }[ds.orgArchitecture];
                capex += (orgCost === undefined ? 0.2 : orgCost);
                var mk4 = ['peru', 'brazil', 'canada', 'australia'];
                for (var ri = 0; ri < mk4.length; ri++) {
                    var mk = mk4[ri];
                    if (!ds[mk + 'Mode'] || (mk === 'australia' && ds.ausPending)) continue;
                    var rev = ds.portfolioReview[mk] || 'maintain';
                    if (rev === 'deepen') { ds[mk + 'Ceil'] *= 1.15; capex += 1.5; load += 0.5; }
                    else if (rev === 'restructure') { ds[mk + 'Penetration'] *= 0.75; ds[mk + 'Capture'] = Math.max(ds[mk + 'Capture'], 0.7); capex += this.RESTRUCTURE_COST[mk]; load += 0.6; }
                    else if (rev === 'exit') { ds[mk + 'Penetration'] = 0; ds[mk + 'Ceil'] = 0; capex -= 0.5; }
                }
                if (ds.ausPending) {
                    var am4 = ds.australiaMode;
                    load += (M[am4] || M.licensing).load;
                    var st4a = this._strain(ds, load);
                    this._grow(ds, st4a);
                    var majority = (am4 === 'jv' && ds.techCap && ds.australiaTiming === 'delay');
                    this._enter(ds, 'australia', am4, 1, (ds.australiaTiming === 'delay' && ds.techCap ? 1.1 : 1.0) * (1 - 0.5 * st4a));
                    if (majority) ds.australiaCapture = 0.6;
                    if (ds.ausRegHit) { ds.australiaCeil *= 0.8; ds.australiaPenetration *= 0.8; }
                    capGain += (M[am4] || M.licensing).capGain * 0.5;
                    ipDelta -= this._ausLeak(am4);
                    newLicenses += (M[am4] || M.licensing).lic;
                    ds.ausPending = false;
                } else {
                    this._grow(ds, this._strain(ds, load));
                }
                ds.orgFit = this._orgFit(ds);
                if (has('codelco_standard')) { newLicenses += 10; ipDelta += 5; }
                newLicenses += Math.round(2 + Math.random() * 4);
                gcpiDelta += Math.round((15 - Math.max(0, ds.rioLatamShare)) * 0.4 * ds.orgFit);
            }

            /* the licensed rival bids with MSP's own software in the next tenders (Peru first) */
            if (ds.rivalArmed && period === 4) { ds.rioLatamShare += 6; ds.peruPenetration *= 0.8; ds.peruCeil *= 0.85; }
            ds.ipScore = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ds.ipScore + ipDelta));
            ds.gcpi = Math.max(0, Math.min(100, ds.gcpi + gcpiDelta));
            ds.capabilityScore = Math.min(100, ds.capabilityScore + capGain);
            ds.totalLicenses += newLicenses;
            ds.budgetSpent = Math.round((ds.budgetSpent + capex) * 100) / 100;
            ds.budget = Math.round((18.5 - ds.budgetSpent) * 100) / 100;
            ds.loadHistory.push(Math.round(load * 100) / 100);

            var prof = this._profit(ds);
            var coreLoss = 52 * Math.max(0, ds.rioLatamShare - 5) / 100 * 0.5 + (ds.priceWar ? 52 * 0.03 : 0) + (ds.copperCrash ? 0.5 : 0);
            ds.profitHistory.push(Math.round(prof * 100) / 100);
            ds.coreLossHistory.push(Math.round(coreLoss * 100) / 100);
            ds.cumProfit += prof + (ds.royalty || 0) - coreLoss;
            ds.capexTotal = Math.round((ds.capexTotal + capex) * 100) / 100;
            ds.portfolioIRR = ds.capexTotal > 0 ? Math.round(prof / ds.capexTotal * 1000) / 10 : 0;
            ds.portfolioValue = Math.round(this._value(ds, period) * 10) / 10;
            ds.marketPenetration = Math.round((ds.peruPenetration + ds.brazilPenetration + ds.canadaPenetration + ds.australiaPenetration) * 10) / 10;

            ds.irrHistory.push(ds.portfolioIRR);
            ds.licensesHistory.push(ds.totalLicenses);
            ds.gcpiHistory.push(ds.gcpi);
            ds.valueHistory.push(ds.portfolioValue);

            var sc = this._computeScore(ds);
            ds.performance = { overallScore: sc.total, grade: sc.tier, tier: sc.tier, outcome: sc.outcome, process: sc.process };
            ds.performanceTier = sc.tier;
            ds.score = sc.total;

            var results = {
                period: period,
                roundIRR: ds.portfolioIRR,
                portfolioIRR: ds.portfolioIRR,
                portfolioValue: ds.portfolioValue,
                intlProfit: Math.round(prof * 100) / 100,
                newLicenses: newLicenses,
                totalLicenses: ds.totalLicenses,
                ipScore: ds.ipScore,
                gcpi: ds.gcpi,
                overallScore: sc.total,
                score: sc.total,
                budgetUsed: Math.round(capex * 100) / 100,
                budgetRemaining: ds.budget,
                eventsTriggered: triggered.length
            };

            setTimeout(((__eqilNext) => function() {
                self._updateBriefing({ currentPeriod: __eqilNext, domainState: ds });
            })(state.currentPeriod + 1), 500);

            return results;
        }

        _ensureModelState(ds) {
            var mk = ['peru', 'brazil', 'canada', 'australia'];
            for (var i = 0; i < mk.length; i++) {
                if (typeof ds[mk[i] + 'Ceil'] !== 'number') ds[mk[i] + 'Ceil'] = 0;
                if (typeof ds[mk[i] + 'Capture'] !== 'number') ds[mk[i] + 'Capture'] = 0;
                if (typeof ds[mk[i] + 'Penetration'] !== 'number') ds[mk[i] + 'Penetration'] = 0;
            }
            var arr = ['profitHistory', 'coreLossHistory', 'valueHistory', 'loadHistory', 'irrHistory', 'licensesHistory', 'gcpiHistory'];
            for (var j = 0; j < arr.length; j++) if (!Array.isArray(ds[arr[j]])) ds[arr[j]] = [];
            if (typeof ds.cumProfit !== 'number') ds.cumProfit = 0;
            if (typeof ds.capexTotal !== 'number') ds.capexTotal = 0;
            if (typeof ds.capabilityScore !== 'number') ds.capabilityScore = 0;
            if (typeof ds.rioLatamShare !== 'number') ds.rioLatamShare = 5;
        }

        /* Year-1 money: a high-commitment mode needs more of it (concave). */
        _funding(mk, mode, budget) {
            var need = { peru: 1.6, brazil: 2.2 }[mk] * Math.max(0.3, (this.ENTRY_MODES[mode] || this.ENTRY_MODES.export).commitment / 5);
            return Math.sqrt(Math.min(1, Math.max(0.05, budget) / need));
        }

        /* Entry: ceiling from institutional distance (absorbed by partner modes) and
           from the capability built earlier (sequence); first-year share from the ramp. */
        _enter(ds, mk, mode, funding, mult) {
            var e = this.MODE_ECON[mode] || this.MODE_ECON.export;
            var dist = this.MARKETS[mk].instDist / 10;
            var capF = (mk === 'peru' || mk === 'brazil') ? 1 : (0.75 + 0.5 * Math.min(100, ds.capabilityScore) / 100);
            var ceil = 22 * (1 - dist * 0.75 * (1 - e.absorb)) * capF * (mult || 1);
            ds[mk + 'Ceil'] = ceil;
            ds[mk + 'Capture'] = (mk === 'brazil' && mode === 'jv') ? 0.4 : e.capture;
            ds[mk + 'Penetration'] = ceil * e.ramp * (funding || 1) * (0.96 + Math.random() * 0.08);
        }

        /* Integration strain: commitments this round, plus what is still being
           integrated from the last round, against the capability to absorb them. */
        _strain(ds, load) {
            var prev = ds.loadHistory.length ? ds.loadHistory[ds.loadHistory.length - 1] : 0;
            var capacity = 0.6 + ds.capabilityScore / 50;
            var over = load + 0.8 * prev - capacity;
            return over > 0 ? Math.min(0.6, 0.5 * over) : 0;
        }

        _grow(ds, strain) {
            var mk = ['peru', 'brazil', 'canada', 'australia'];
            var g = Math.max(0.05, 0.3 + 0.15 * ds.capabilityScore / 100 - strain);
            for (var i = 0; i < mk.length; i++) {
                var c = ds[mk[i] + 'Ceil'];
                /* a wholly owned greenfield at high institutional distance learns the market alone (Uppsala): half the pace */
                var slow = (ds[mk[i] + 'Mode'] === 'wos_greenfield' && this.MARKETS[mk[i]].instDist >= 6) ? 0.5 : 1;
                if (c > 0) ds[mk[i] + 'Penetration'] += (c - ds[mk[i] + 'Penetration']) * g * slow * (0.95 + Math.random() * 0.1);
            }
        }

        _ausLeak(mode) {
            return { licensing: 10, jv: 4, wos_greenfield: 0, wos_acquisition: 0 }[mode] || 0;
        }

        _orgFit(ds) {
            var modes = [ds.peruMode, ds.brazilMode, ds.canadaMode, ds.australiaMode];
            var active = 0, wos = 0;
            var mk = ['peru', 'brazil', 'canada', 'australia'];
            for (var i = 0; i < 4; i++) {
                if (ds[mk[i] + 'Ceil'] > 0) active++;
                if (modes[i] === 'wos_greenfield' || modes[i] === 'wos_acquisition') wos++;
            }
            var o = ds.orgArchitecture;
            if (o === 'geographic') return active >= 3 ? 1.0 : 0.85;
            if (o === 'global_product') return wos >= 3 ? 0.95 : 0.85;
            if (o === 'matrix') return ds.capabilityScore >= 85 ? 1.0 : 0.8;
            if (o === 'international_div') return active <= 2 ? 0.95 : 0.8;
            return 0.85;
        }

        /* International operating profit this year, CLP B. */
        _profit(ds) {
            var mk = ['peru', 'brazil', 'canada', 'australia'];
            var ipF = 0.6 + 0.4 * ds.ipScore / 100;
            var tot = 0;
            for (var i = 0; i < 4; i++) {
                var pool = this.MARKETS[mk[i]].size * 12;
                var priceF = (ds.priceWar && (mk[i] === 'peru' || mk[i] === 'brazil')) ? 0.85 : 1;
                tot += ds[mk[i] + 'Penetration'] / 100 * pool * ds[mk[i] + 'Capture'] * ipF * priceF;
            }
            return tot * (ds.orgFit || 1) * (ds.copperCrash ? 0.95 : 1);
        }

        /* Value created so far: profit to date + three years of the current run-rate,
           net of capital, the facility draw beyond the programme and home-market erosion. */
        _value(ds, period) {
            var last = ds.profitHistory.length ? ds.profitHistory[ds.profitHistory.length - 1] : 0;
            var lastCore = ds.coreLossHistory.length ? ds.coreLossHistory[ds.coreLossHistory.length - 1] : 0;
            var yearsLeft = 4 - period;
            var future = (last + (ds.royalty || 0) - lastCore) * (yearsLeft + 3);
            var overrun = Math.max(0, ds.budgetSpent - 18.5);
            return ds.cumProfit + future - ds.capexTotal - 0.6 * overrun;
        }

        _computeScore(ds) {
            ds = ds || {};
            var v = typeof ds.portfolioValue === 'number' ? ds.portfolioValue : 0;
            var outcome = Math.max(0, Math.min(70, (v - this.SCORE_V0) / (this.SCORE_V1 - this.SCORE_V0) * 70));
            var ip = typeof ds.ipScore === 'number' ? ds.ipScore : 100;
            var gc = typeof ds.gcpi === 'number' ? ds.gcpi : 50;
            var cap = ds.capabilityScore || 0;
            var process = Math.max(0, Math.min(10, (ip - 60) / 40 * 10)) + Math.max(0, Math.min(10, (gc - 40) / 30 * 10)) + Math.max(0, Math.min(10, cap / 80 * 10));
            var total = Math.round(Math.max(0, Math.min(100, outcome + process)));
            var tier = 'developing';
            if (total >= 80) tier = 'leader';
            else if (total >= 60) tier = 'strong';
            else if (total >= 40) tier = 'emerging';
            return { total: total, tier: tier, outcome: Math.round(outcome), process: Math.round(process) };
        }

        setupUI(uiManager) {
            uiManager.bind('currentDay', 'currentPeriod');
            uiManager.bind('maxPeriods', 'maxPeriods');
            uiManager.bind('budgetDisplay', 'domainState.budget',
                function(v) { return 'CLP ' + v.toFixed(1) + 'B'; });
            uiManager.bind('irrDisplay', 'domainState.portfolioIRR',
                function(v) { return v.toFixed(1) + '%'; });
            uiManager.bind('licensesDisplay', 'domainState.totalLicenses');
            uiManager.bind('ipScoreDisplay', 'domainState.ipScore');
            uiManager.bind('gcpiDisplay', 'domainState.gcpi');
        }

        getChartConfig() {
            var es = this._lang() === 'es';
            return {
                portfolioChart: {
                    type: 'line',
                    data: {
                        labels: [],
                        datasets: [{
                            label: (es ? 'Retorno del capital (%)' : 'Return on capital (%)'),
                            data: [],
                            borderColor: '#1a237e',
                            backgroundColor: 'rgba(26,35,126,0.1)',
                            borderWidth: 3,
                            fill: true,
                            tension: 0.3
                        }, {
                            label: 'GCPI',
                            data: [],
                            borderColor: '#e65100',
                            backgroundColor: 'rgba(230,81,0,0.1)',
                            borderWidth: 2,
                            fill: false,
                            tension: 0.3,
                            yAxisID: 'y1'
                        }]
                    },
                    options: {
                        responsive: true,
                        maintainAspectRatio: false,
                        plugins: { title: { display: true, text: (es ? 'Desempeño del portafolio' : 'Portfolio performance') } },
                        scales: {
                            y: { beginAtZero: true, title: { display: true, text: (es ? 'Retorno (%)' : 'Return (%)') } },
                            y1: { position: 'right', beginAtZero: true, max: 100, title: { display: true, text: 'GCPI' }, grid: { drawOnChartArea: false } }
                        }
                    }
                },
                licensesChart: {
                    type: 'bar',
                    data: {
                        labels: [],
                        datasets: [{
                            label: (es ? 'Licencias OrePlan Pro' : 'OrePlan Pro licenses'),
                            data: [],
                            backgroundColor: 'rgba(46,125,50,0.7)',
                            borderColor: '#2e7d32',
                            borderWidth: 2
                        }]
                    },
                    options: {
                        responsive: true,
                        maintainAspectRatio: false,
                        plugins: { title: { display: true, text: (es ? 'Licencias globales de OrePlan Pro' : 'OrePlan Pro global license count') } },
                        scales: { y: { beginAtZero: true } }
                    }
                }
            };
        }

        getChartData(state) {
            var labels = state.domainState.irrHistory.map(function(_, i) { return 'R' + (i + 1); });
            return {
                portfolioChart: {
                    labels: labels,
                    datasets: [
                        { data: state.domainState.irrHistory },
                        { data: state.domainState.gcpiHistory }
                    ]
                },
                licensesChart: {
                    labels: labels,
                    datasets: [{ data: state.domainState.licensesHistory }]
                }
            };
        }

        /* What this run actually did that a practitioner would call a mistake, each
           with an estimated cost; read only from the run's own state (never invented). */
        _mistakes(ds) {
            var out = [];
            if (ds.brazilMode === 'jv' || ds.brazilCorrection === 'renegotiate' || ds.brazilCorrection === 'escalate_legal') {
                if (ds.brazilCorrection !== 'convert_wos' && (ds.brazilMode === 'jv')) out.push({ id: 'minority_jv', w: 9 });
            }
            if (ds.canadaMode === 'licensing') out.push({ id: 'license_canada', w: 8 });
            if (ds.australiaMode === 'licensing') out.push({ id: 'license_australia', w: 6 });
            if (ds.australiaMode === 'wos_greenfield' && ds.australiaTiming === 'now') out.push({ id: 'aus_greenfield_now', w: 9 });
            else if (ds.australiaMode === 'wos_acquisition' && ds.australiaTiming === 'now') out.push({ id: 'aus_acq_now', w: 6 });
            if (ds.rioResponse === 'price_deterrence') out.push({ id: 'price_war', w: 10 });
            if (ds.rioResponse === 'licensing_deal') out.push({ id: 'license_rival', w: 7 });
            if (ds.budgetSpent > 18.5) out.push({ id: 'overrun', w: 4 });
            var lh = ds.loadHistory || [];
            for (var i = 0; i < lh.length; i++) { if (lh[i] >= 2) { out.push({ id: 'fragmented', w: 5 }); break; } }
            out.sort(function(a, b) { return b.w - a.w; });
            return out;
        }

        getPerformanceSummary(history) {
            if (!history || !history.length) return {};
            var last = history[history.length - 1];
            var ds = last.domainState || (last.state && last.state.domainState) || {};
            var sc = this._computeScore(ds);
            var t = this._t.bind(this);
            var mistakes = this._mistakes(ds);
            var insights = [];
            for (var i = 0; i < mistakes.length && insights.length < 3; i++) insights.push(t('dm_' + mistakes[i].id));
            if (ds.techCap && ds.australiaMode === 'jv' && ds.australiaTiming === 'delay') insights.push(t('dg_sequence'));
            if (ds.peruMode === 'wos_greenfield' || ds.peruMode === 'branch') insights.push(t('dg_beachhead'));
            if (ds.rioResponse === 'deepen_chile') insights.push(t('dg_presence'));
            if ((ds.ipScore || 0) >= 90 && !mistakes.length) insights.push(t('dg_ip'));
            if (insights.length < 3) { var wk = this._weakestMarket(ds); if (wk) insights.push(wk); }
            if (insights.length < 3) insights.push(this._kpiLine(ds));
            if (insights.length < 3) insights.push(t('dg_value'));
            insights = insights.slice(0, 5);
            /* v2.0.1: the no-mistake line is only true of a good run; a weak run without a named mistake is told where the value went */
            var turning = mistakes.length ? t('tp_' + mistakes[0].id) : (sc.total >= 60 ? t('tp_none') : t('tp_spread') + ' ' + this._valueLine(ds));
            return {
                totalPeriods: history.length,
                totalScore: sc.total,
                overallScore: sc.total,
                score: sc.total,
                composite: sc.total,
                outcomeScore: sc.outcome,
                processScore: sc.process,
                performance: sc.tier,
                performanceKey: sc.tier,
                performanceLabel: t('tier_' + sc.tier),
                portfolioValue: ds.portfolioValue || 0,
                portfolioIRR: ds.portfolioIRR || 0,
                totalLicenses: (typeof ds.totalLicenses === 'number') ? ds.totalLicenses : 67,
                ipScore: ds.ipScore || 0,
                gcpi: ds.gcpi || 0,
                capitalSpent: ds.budgetSpent || 0,
                turningPoint: turning,
                insights: insights
            };
        }

        _t(key) {
            try {
                if (window.mySimulation && typeof window.mySimulation.t === 'function') {
                    var v = window.mySimulation.t(key);
                    if (v && v !== key) return v;
                }
            } catch (e) {}
            var tr = this.getTranslations();
            var l = this._lang();
            return (tr[l] && tr[l][key]) || (tr.en && tr.en[key]) || key;
        }

        formatCompletionMessage(summary) {
            var s = summary || {};
            var t = this._t.bind(this);
            var lang = this._lang();
            var n = this._num.bind(this);
            var esc = function(x) { return String(x == null ? '' : x).replace(/&/g, '&amp;').replace(/</g, '&lt;').replace(/>/g, '&gt;'); };
            var html = '<div class="msp-entry-cm" role="region" aria-label="' + esc(t('cm_title')) + '">';
            html += '<div class="msp-entry-cm-score"><span class="msp-entry-cm-num">' + (s.totalScore || 0) + '</span><span class="msp-entry-cm-den">/100</span></div>';
            html += '<div class="msp-entry-cm-tier">' + esc(s.performanceLabel || '') + '</div>';
            html += '<div class="msp-entry-cm-sub">' + esc(t('cm_outcome')) + ': ' + (s.outcomeScore || 0) + '/70 · ' + esc(t('cm_process')) + ': ' + (s.processScore || 0) + '/30</div>';
            html += '<ul class="msp-entry-cm-kpis">';
            html += '<li><b>' + esc(t('cm_value')) + '</b> CLP ' + n(s.portfolioValue, 1, lang) + 'B</li>';
            html += '<li><b>' + esc(t('cm_capital')) + '</b> CLP ' + n(s.capitalSpent, 1, lang) + 'B / 18' + (lang === 'es' ? ',' : '.') + '5B</li>';
            html += '<li><b>' + esc(t('ip_label')) + '</b> ' + (s.ipScore || 0) + '</li>';
            html += '<li><b>' + esc(t('gcpi_label')) + '</b> ' + (s.gcpi || 0) + '</li>';
            html += '</ul>';
            html += '<h4>' + esc(t('cm_turning')) + '</h4><p>' + esc(s.turningPoint || '') + '</p>';
            html += '<h4>' + esc(t('cm_insights')) + '</h4><ul>';
            var ins = s.insights || [];
            for (var i = 0; i < ins.length; i++) html += '<li>' + esc(ins[i]) + '</li>';
            html += '</ul><h4>' + esc(t('cm_questions')) + '</h4><ol><li>' + esc(t('cm_q1')) + '</li><li>' + esc(t('cm_q2')) + '</li><li>' + esc(t('cm_q3')) + '</li></ol>';
            html += '</div>';
            return html;
        }

        getHint(state, results) {
            if (!results) return null;
            var t = this._t.bind(this);
            var ds = (state && state.domainState) || {};
            var lh = ds.loadHistory || [];
            if (lh.length && lh[lh.length - 1] >= 2) return t('hint_strain');
            if (results.ipScore < 85) return t('hint_ip_risk');
            if (results.budgetRemaining < 0) return t('hint_budget_low');
            if (results.gcpi < 45) return t('hint_gcpi_low');
            return null;
        }

